n></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you help a local though quests, the more trades he propose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/76884284ae2d09bb8da3ab5e6100a5af.poster.avif?t=1753863872\" width=1280 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/76884284ae2d09bb8da3ab5e6100a5af.webm?t=1753863872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/76884284ae2d09bb8da3ab5e6100a5af.mp4?t=1753863872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enrich</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tools are the main engine of your economic growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/d17aae1b55551d85367e2e68aef0d701.poster.avif?t=1753863872\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/d17aae1b55551d85367e2e68aef0d701.webm?t=1753863872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/d17aae1b55551d85367e2e68aef0d701.mp4?t=1753863872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hamlet is also a story. Learn more about what happened recently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse